---
// The hero: a living data membrane the visitor scrolls through (WebGL, see src/scripts/membrane.js).
import '../styles/hero.css';
---
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="title">
  <div class="stage">
    <canvas id="gl" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <p class="sr-only">Visual: a translucent surface made of fine lines, with a line chart running across it. Four structures behind it push it into shape. Scrolling carries you through the surface to the other side, where the four become visible: Business Intelligence, Artificial Intelligence, Leadership and Entrepreneurship. The data is illustrative.</p>

    <header class="top">
      <a class="name" href="#top">Wilson Mota</a>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="#work">Work</a>
        <a href="#cv">CV</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="copy" id="copy">
      <p class="kicker mono">Business Intelligence Manager</p>
      <h1 id="title"><span>Beyond the</span> <span>dashboards<span class="dot">.</span></span></h1>
      <div class="under">
        <p class="lede">What if the charts I build are only the surface?</p>
        <a class="cta" href="#work">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="behind" id="behind">
      <p class="kicker mono">Behind the dashboard</p>
      <p class="big">I design data platforms, build with AI, lead a BI team and start things from zero.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="readout">
      <p class="r-hint mono" id="hint" aria-hidden="true" hidden>Point at a force</p>
      <p class="r-note mono" aria-hidden="true">Illustrative data</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Each force: its name, what the shape means in plain words, and one fact. -->
    <nav class="forces" id="forces" aria-label="What lies behind the dashboard">
      <a class="force" href="#bi" data-k="0"><b>Business Intelligence</b><span>Three layers of data: source, model, report. The source arrives broken; the report is whole.</span><i>Power BI platform owner · Dremio · Databricks</i></a>
      <a class="force" href="#ai" data-k="1"><b>Artificial Intelligence</b><span>Many lines of information converge on one answer.</span><i>Trading bot · Personal CFO · Property Deal Radar</i></a>
      <a class="force" href="#leadership" data-k="2"><b>Leadership</b><span>One point, deep down, holding up a ring near the surface.</span><i>A team of six BI developers</i></a>
      <a class="force" href="#entrepreneurship" data-k="3"><b>Entrepreneurship</b><span>A path that branches. Most ends are open; one reaches the surface.</span><i>WeValue · freelance · three ideas being tested</i></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/membrane.js';
</script>
